WEBVTT

00:02:29.855 --> 00:02:33.045
unajikusanya kuwa idadi kubwa
ya kushangaza sana.

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:35.323
Watoto bilioni moja ulimwenguni kila mwaka

00:02:35.347 --> 00:02:37.291
wanaopitia aina fulani ya ukatili.

00:02:37.315 --> 00:02:39.315
Hiyo ni mtoto mmoja kwa kila wawili.

00:02:39.339 --> 00:02:41.072
Hili ni tatizo la ulimwengu wote.

00:02:42.609 --> 00:02:44.342
Hivyo ni nini kinachonipa matumaini?

00:02:44.657 --> 00:02:46.395
Ngoja nizungumzie kuhusu Sweden na Uganda.

00:02:46.419 --> 00:02:49.466
Labda ni nchi mbili zilizo tofauti sana
kama unavyofikiri.

00:02:49.855 --> 00:02:51.276
Ukizungumza na mchumi,

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.264
wanaweza kusema kuwa Sweden
ina kipato cha wastani

00:02:54.288 --> 00:02:56.026
wa takriban dola 50,000 kwa mwaka.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:58.050
Na Uganda, ni dola 2,000.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.582
Mwana historia atasema